                "query": "SELECT count(*) FROM UserAction WHERE demoCode = {{demoCode}} FACET CASES (WHERE rageClick AS 'Rage clicks', WHERE deadClick AS 'Dead clicks', WHERE errorClick AS 'Error clicks') SINCE 1 week ago"
